SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于詹庄园\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          詹森庄园的历史可以追溯到1926年，当年仅21岁的\n          <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           Carl Axel Janson和妻子\n           <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            Peggy Janson\n           </span>\n           从瑞典来到巴拿马这块富饶而又原始的土地；随后Carl购置了一个农场用来做乳品生意，从瑞典引入了Brangus牛与一些不同的马种，又从佛罗里达引入了不同的鱼种投入到庄园附近的湖中来打造一个多样多元的农场，这些都展示出了他独到与长远规划的眼光。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SJtLL2ZuIyguQ47y6atmxJ5AibBwjia2QCxzeboJoUq9hZjAAzY2R1LMcCvcATpKDJekWTgmKAb3yA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           1980年代中期，家族意识到农场的自然风土条件对于咖啡种植的适宜性，于是开启了咖啡的种植，1990年Carl的儿子（\n           <span style='letter-spacing: normal;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;text-align: left;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n            Ricardo, Carl, Peter and Michael）\n           </span>\n           接管了农场的业务，成立了Jason Coffee，继续秉承着父亲对于农场生态，对于家族生意以及对于所有产品的品质要求发展下属的所有业务，也是詹森开始进入咖啡领域的开始。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SJtLL2ZuIyguQ47y6atmxJO5bibt86ZE0AicPmJice1GImqIMLFhJOW3ZzdXB5F3FgPAHEcsrCn3A0Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           30多年过去了，现在庄园有Carl的孙子辈的Kai和Janette以及家族第四代Miguel（Janette的儿子）来管理运营，庄园种植品种有卡杜艾、卡杜拉、帕卡马拉以及瑰夏。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          查资料时，查到农场里有一处设施让我感觉到很温馨和感动，就是给所有工人们提供的小儿子Day Care中心，身为父母（小朋友还年龄较小）的我非常有感触，一个让你放心踏实的托儿所是多么的重要，这里可以让工人们踏实放心的去工作，小孩子在这里有玩了的设施，有老师看管做一些早教工作，真的是超级超级棒！\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SJtLL2ZuIyguQ47y6atmxJLCVFgRedpdTfPNzZJY2hqAXanaFjdFX1npuXTVvJom3QwKHmS3aa1A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          除此之外，家族对于环保和生态保护也有自己的一些实践，比如在自己的咖啡店或者农场里使用玻璃器具以及可循环使用的容器避免塑料垃圾的生成；还有一个为了保护附近的原始生态的保育室，由Miguel来负责管理，从农场附近的原始森林里收集一些原生的植株种子在这里保育，同时也开放一部分空间给公众，对于来访的自然爱好者客人们可以从这里拿一些回家自己培养种植；农场的电力主要有400块太阳能板来供给，同时燃烧的燃料也来源于咖啡生产过程中的一些产物比如说羊皮纸。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于这个批次 Lagunas\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这个批次来自于农场的一个地块Lagunas，它的名字来源于附近的Lagoon湖与湿地，位于1350 - 1400米的海拔高度。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           获奖记录\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           Best of Panama 2013\n          </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           Gesha 水洗 #2\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Best of Panama 2016 Gesha 日晒 #3\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           Best of Panama 2016 Gesha 水洗 #14\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Best\n          <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           of Panama 2017 Gesha 日晒 #11\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           Best of Panama 2018 Gesha 日晒 #7\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            Best of Panama 2018 Gesha 水洗 #3/10\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n             Best of Panama 2019 Gesha 日晒&amp;特殊处理 #2/14\n            </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Best of Panama 2019 Pacamara 日晒 #2\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n              Best of Panama 2019\n             </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n              Gesha 水洗\n             </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n              #10\n             </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n               Best of Panama 2020\n              </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n               Gesha 日晒 #19\n              </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n                Best of Panama 2020 Pacamara组\n               </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n                #1\n               </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n               Best of Panama 2021\n              </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n               Gesha 日晒 #12\n              </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n               Best of Panama 2022\n              </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n               Gesha 日晒 #7\n              </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n                Best of Panama 2022\n               </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n                Gesha 水洗 #7\n               </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            Best of Panama 2022\n           </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            Varietals品种组 #10\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft Y